          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Lactation Support Matters",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_Y8CJKe": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Many new moms and new parents benefit greatly from timely, professional breastfeeding support. Studies show that having the right Lactation Support Resources can improve breastfeeding success rates and help parents feel more confident along their journey. That’s why Ameda partners with trusted providers, including lactation consultants, to make sure you receive the expertise you need—exactly when you need it.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
