        "heading_hcitUc": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What Is a Lactation Consultant?",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_ghagq9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A lactation consultant is a healthcare professional who specializes in breastfeeding support and guidance. These experts are trained to help new mothers overcome common breastfeeding challenges and provide personalized advice on various aspects of breastfeeding. Whether you are dealing with latch issues, managing milk supply, or simply seeking reassurance, a lactation consultant can offer the support you need.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
