      ],
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">Lactation consultants can be an invaluable resource at any stage of your breastfeeding journey. You can consult with them during pregnancy to prepare for breastfeeding, immediately after birth to establish a good latch, or several months into breastfeeding to address any ongoing concerns. Their services include breastfeeding education, hands-on assistance with latch and positioning, and strategies to boost milk supply. By working with a lactation consultant, you can gain confidence and ensure a positive breastfeeding experience.</p>",
