          "settings": {
            "title": "International Board-Certified Lactation Consultants (IBCLCs)",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "IBCLCs are the Gold Standard in lactation care, having completed extensive education and clinical training in breastfeeding management. Whether you need an in-home visit, an in-office appointment, or a virtual consultation via telehealth, lactation consultants from the IBCLCs can offer personalized strategies tailored to your needs.",
