            "title": "Ameda Trusted Providers",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "",
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"splitted\">\n    <div>\n        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://book.nestcollaborative.com/1?partner=ameda\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0849/8062/9819/files/NEST-Logo.webp?v=1730213068\" style=\"height: 6rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;\" />\n        </a>\n        <h6>The Nest</h6>\n        <p>The Nest offers personalized breastfeeding support tailored to meet specific breastfeeding needs through a network of lactation consultants, providing in-home, in-office, and online consultations. They simplify the process for new parents by handling insurance billing and making expert lactation care accessible and stress-free. Friendly and knowledgeable, The Nest’s lactation consultants guide parents step-by-step through latch techniques, pumping schedules, and more.</p>\n<a href=\"https://book.nestcollaborative.com/1?partner=ameda\" class=\"inline-flex card__collection--arrow\">\n    The Nest\n    <span class=\"has-ltr-icon flex items-center mis-2\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4.696 12h14.686m-7.007-7.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5\"></path></svg></span>\n</a>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://registration.mytln.care/?utm_source=partner_referral&utm_medium=interlink&utm_campaign=Ameda\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0849/8062/9819/files/TLN_Horizontal_Green-TM.svg?v=1730213068\" style=\"height: 6rem;\" />\n        </a>\n        <h6 style=\"margin-top: 1rem;\">The Lactation Network</h6>\n        <p>The Lactation Network (TLN) connects parents with insurance-covered lactation support resources. With a nationwide directory of lactation consultants, TLN offers in-home, in-office, and telehealth consultations while managing insurance claims and answering breastfeeding questions. Their streamlined process ensures easy scheduling and maximized coverage benefits, helping parents avoid hidden surprises or unexpected costs.</p>\n<a href=\"https://registration.mytln.care/?utm_source=partner_referral&utm_medium=interlink&utm_campaign=Ameda\" class=\"inline-flex card__collection--arrow\">\n    TLN\n    <span class=\"has-ltr-icon flex items-center mis-2\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4.696 12h14.686m-7.007-7.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5\"></path></svg></span>\n</a>\n    </div>\n</div>",
